  "items": [
    {
      "source": "This factory implements <a href=\"../../../beans/factory/InitializingBean.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>InitializingBean</code></a> and <a href=\"../../../beans/factory/DisposableBean.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>DisposableBean</code></a>\nand is expected typically to be declared as a Spring-managed bean.",
      "translation": "该工厂实现了<a href=\"../../../beans/factory/InitializingBean.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>InitializingBean</code></a>和<a href=\"../../../beans/factory/DisposableBean.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>DisposableBean</code></a>，通常预期声明为 Spring 管理的 Bean。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "By default, this is set to <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/concurrent/Executors.html#newCachedThreadPool(java.util.concurrent.ThreadFactory)\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.concurrent\"><code>Executors.newCachedThreadPool(ThreadFactory)</code></a>,\nwhich mirrors <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.net.http/java/net/http/HttpClient.Builder.html#executor(java.util.concurrent.Executor)\" title=\"class or interface in java.net.http\"><code>HttpClient.Builder.executor(Executor)</code></a>.",
      "translation": "默认情况下，此值设置为 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/concurrent/Executors.html#newCachedThreadPool(java.util.concurrent.ThreadFactory)\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.concurrent\"><code>Executors.newCachedThreadPool(ThreadFactory)</code></a>，\n这与 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.net.http/java/net/http/HttpClient.Builder.html#executor(java.util.concurrent.Executor)\" title=\"class or interface in java.net.http\"><code>HttpClient.Builder.executor(Executor)</code></a> 相对应。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "By default set to \"jdk-http\".",
      "translation": "默认设置为\"jdk-http\"。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return the configured <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/concurrent/Executor.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.concurrent\"><code>Executor</code></a>.",
      "translation": "返回配置的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/concurrent/Executor.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.concurrent\"><code>Executor</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Invoked by the containing <code>BeanFactory</code> on destruction of a bean.",
      "translation": "由包含的<code>BeanFactory</code>在销毁 Bean 时调用。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>executor</code> - the executor to use",
      "translation": "<code>executor</code> - 要使用的执行器",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>threadPrefix</code> - the thread prefix to use",
      "translation": "<code>threadPrefix</code> - 要使用的线程前缀",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "This method allows the bean instance to perform validation of its overall\nconfiguration and final initialization when all bean properties have been set.",
      "translation": "此方法允许 Bean 实例在其所有属性设置完成后，执行其整体配置验证和最终初始化。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Invoked by the containing <code>BeanFactory</code> after it has set all bean properties\nand satisfied <a href=\"../../../beans/factory/BeanFactoryAware.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>BeanFactoryAware</code></a>, <code>ApplicationContextAware</code> etc.",
      "translation": "由包含的<code>BeanFactory</code>在设置所有 bean 属性并满足<a href=\"../../../beans/factory/BeanFactoryAware.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>BeanFactoryAware</code></a>、<code>ApplicationContextAware</code>等接口后调用。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Configure the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/concurrent/Executor.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.concurrent\"><code>Executor</code></a> to use for <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.net.http/java/net/http/HttpClient.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.net.http\"><code>HttpClient</code></a> exchanges.",
      "translation": "配置用于 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/concurrent/Executor.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.concurrent\"><code>Executor</code></a>` 的 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.net.http/java/net/http/HttpClient.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.net.http\"><code>HttpClient</code></a>` 交换。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">Description copied from interface: <code><a href=\"../../../beans/factory/InitializingBean.html#afterPropertiesSet()\">InitializingBean</a></code></span>",
      "translation": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">描述从接口复制：<code><a href=\"../../../beans/factory/InitializingBean.html#afterPropertiesSet()\">InitializingBean</a></code></span>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">Description copied from interface: <code><a href=\"../../../beans/factory/DisposableBean.html#destroy()\">DisposableBean</a></code></span>",
      "translation": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">描述从接口复制：<code><a href=\"../../../beans/factory/DisposableBean.html#destroy()\">DisposableBean</a></code></span>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Configure the thread prefix to initialize the executor with.",
      "translation": "配置线程前缀以初始化执行器。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a href=\"../../../beans/factory/InitializingBean.html#afterPropertiesSet()\">afterPropertiesSet</a></code> in interface <code><a href=\"../../../beans/factory/InitializingBean.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\">InitializingBean</a></code>",
      "translation": "`<code><a href=\"../../../beans/factory/InitializingBean.html#afterPropertiesSet()\">afterPropertiesSet</a></code>` 接口 `<code><a href=\"../../../beans/factory/InitializingBean.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\">InitializingBean</a></code>` 中",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a href=\"../../../beans/factory/DisposableBean.html#destroy()\">destroy</a></code> in interface <code><a href=\"../../../beans/factory/DisposableBean.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\">DisposableBean</a></code>",
      "translation": "`<code><a href=\"../../../beans/factory/DisposableBean.html#destroy()\">destroy</a></code>` 接口 `<code><a href=\"../../../beans/factory/DisposableBean.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\">DisposableBean</a></code>` 中",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Exception.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">Exception</a></code> - in the event of misconfiguration (such as failure to set an\nessential property) or if initialization fails for any other reason",
      "translation": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Exception.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">Exception</a></code> - 在配置错误（例如未设置必需属性）或因任何其他原因导致初始化失败的情况下",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Exception.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">Exception</a></code> - in case of shutdown errors. Exceptions will get logged\nbut not rethrown to allow other beans to release their resources as well.",
      "translation": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Exception.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">Exception</a></code> - 在发生关闭错误时。异常将被记录，但不会重新抛出，以便允许其他 Bean 释放其资源。",
      "count": 1
    },
